  "extractionNotes": "Closing note: the pregnancy sickness benefit and the maternity benefit were both established and paid. Sick pay 2026-02-01..2026-03-05 (code B) by the employer; six e-ZLA certificates 2026-02-01..2026-08-22 on the ZUS list, collapsed into one sick note; the last one runs past the birth and is overlapped by maternity. The sickness-benefit period (2026-03-06 to the day before the birth) is inferred. Maternity 2026-08-09..2026-12-26 and parental 2026-12-27..2027-08-07 are the claim (ZAM and Z-3; Z-3 application date 2026-08-31); the father declares non-use. 81.5% inferred (joint claim within 21 days; box legibility unclear). Previous child: benefit-recipient title 2024-03-14..2025-03-12 in the register; the split into 140 + 224 days is inferred. Salary table 2025-02..2026-01: contractual 7000.00 every month; parental leave until 2025-03-12, then 2025-05..2025-11 not worked with payroll absence code 121 (unpaid / childcare-type leave), so those months have 0 days worked and should drop out of the base. contributionBase is inferred equal to column 6."
